{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_01_end","storyGroup":"act41side","storySort":3,"storyDependence":"act41side_level_act41side_01_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EA-1","storyName":"扉页所见","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"与姐姐不欢而散后，拉芙希妮试图驱散紫火遭遇失败。想离开城市的布莉吉被迫滞留城外，而理应维护城市秩序的深池却更加剧了城中的危局。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act41side/level_act41side_01_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act41side_01","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":1,"next":3,"characters":["拉芙希妮","友善的居民","“守灵人”","涅梅丝","背后的声音","“放逐王”","担忧的居民","“官僚”","匆忙的士兵","布莉吉","烦躁的守卫"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-150,0","duration":"1","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.7","isblock":"true","id":13},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":14},{"type":"charslot","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"（小声）......抱歉了。","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"女士，请留步。","id":18},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"charslot","id":20},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"哦，苇草，是你！你之前突然离席，我还以为是我们的招待有什么不周到的地方呢。","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......不，我很感谢你们的款待，只是当时突然想起还有事。现在我还有一些问题，能请您为我解答吗？","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"行，你问吧。","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你知道自己身上正燃烧着火焰吗？","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"火？你是说祝福？真奇怪，你居然能看见其他人身上的祝福？","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"multiline","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我也是被人提醒，这才意识到的——","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"multiline","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"等等，你是说，你知道，但你们都看不见？这怎么可能呢？","id":37},{"type":"dialog","id":38},{"type":"charslot","id":39},{"type":"text","text":"居民将手伸向自己腰间。","id":40},{"type":"text","text":"为了驱散沼泽中的黑雾，塔拉人的祖先会在腰间挎上一朵以源石技艺固定住的小小的火焰。","id":41},{"type":"text","text":"这样的习俗在维多利亚彻底掌控塔拉后被严令禁止。","id":42},{"type":"text","text":"时移世异，不必再顾及维多利亚禁令的塔拉人，至少是纳斯尔纱人，选择在腰间挎上小巧的源石灯。","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"你也知道燃料不够，加上宵禁存在，所以源石灯我们开不起，也不必开。不过......只要像这样......","id":45},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","focus":"l","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#4$1","duration":"1.5","focus":"all","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"是她的火......在这灯上显出了颜色......","id":54},{"type":"dialog","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":56},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#4$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","focus":"l","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","duration":"1","focus":"all","id":60},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"现在城里人一开灯就是这个颜色，换了别的颜色的元器件也一样。","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你们难道不担心吗？","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"你也看到了，现在纳斯尔纱一切向好，所以这只能是红龙的祝福，不会有别的解释了。","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"可是——","id":69},{"type":"dialog","id":70},{"type":"charslot","id":71},{"type":"text","text":"可是？","id":72},{"type":"text","text":"可是一个鲁莽的归乡者，要告诉她这火的存在与不祥勾连？她不会相信的。","id":73},{"type":"text","text":"也许直接一些的办法反而会奏效，拉芙希妮在心中如此祈祷。","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"可是我也想感受一下“红龙的祝福”，所以......我能握一下您的手吗？","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"但你都进城了，城市里的人迟早会得到的呀。","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"只是个小小的心愿。","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"唉，特意回到塔拉来，你也不容易。","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"对了，你是做什么的？","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我......我会一些医疗手段，我的源石技艺可以辅助我，仅此而已。","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"原来你是个医生，城里正需要医生呢。","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"来吧，让我们握手——","id":88},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":91},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":93},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_field_magloop","channel":"2","volume":"0.8","loop":"true","id":94},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"2","fadetime":"2.5","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":96},{"type":"text","text":"她握紧女人掌心结着老茧的手，同时让火从自己的手腕处向着对方蔓延。","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"谢谢您......","id":99},{"type":"dialog","id":100},{"type":"charslot","id":101},{"type":"text","text":"她闭上眼。","id":102},{"type":"text","text":"闭上眼，去回忆那些曾被自己抚平痛苦，不再被迫滞留人世的对象——","id":103},{"type":"text","text":"去温暖这冰冷的火。","id":104},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"呃......","id":107},{"type":"dialog","id":108},{"type":"charslot","id":109},{"type":"text","text":"紫色的火逐渐褪去。在那之下，苍白的、摇曳着友善笑容的面庞慢慢清晰起来。","id":110},{"type":"text","text":"于是她试图将更多紫色的部分消去，却没能及时看见女人面色陡变的一瞬。","id":111},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":112,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"天啊，我——","id":114},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"我的手——你对我的手做了什么？我的手没知觉了！","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"什么？！","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"multiline","name":"友善的居民","text":"还有我的祝福，也感受不到了！你到底在做什么？","id":120},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"0.8","id":121},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":122},{"type":"multiline","name":"友善的居民","text":"放开我！","id":123},{"type":"dialog","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"0.7","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","duration":"0.7","id":127},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"苇草！","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“守灵人”？","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"苇草小姐，请先放开这位可怜的女士。","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我——","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"（摇头）","id":138},{"type":"dialog","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":141},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.6","channel":"step","loop":"false","id":142},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step","fadetime":"1.5","id":143},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"抱歉，女士。","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"这位苇草小姐没有恶意，我以我的人格担保。","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"可她说她是医生，医生怎么会......","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"基于源石技艺的医术偶尔也会有一些副作用。看，你的手，这不是好好的吗？","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"可我还是感觉不到——","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"您不会有事的。","id":156},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"charslot","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"离群的守灵人抬手，以温热的掌心轻抚受惊女人的前额。并不是什么奇异的动作，女人却逐渐安定下来。","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"好、好，我相信你。是的，我的手还在，祝福也还在......","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"夜幕就要降临，还是尽快回到房屋之中吧。","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"苇草小姐，您也还有另一场宴会要参加，不是吗？","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"宴会？","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......嗯，宴会。","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"那么，现在，请允许我为您引路离开这里。","id":171},{"type":"dialog","id":172},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":173},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"charslot","id":176},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":178},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":179,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"......","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“守灵人”，既然你回来了，那代表莫兰他们已经安顿下来了？","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"没错，他们会住在遗迹略微外围一点的地方。这个时间，大概还在清扫遗迹旁那些没人的小屋吧。","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"谢谢。","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"不用。要说的话，我更希望您能称呼我为“涅梅丝”，因为我如今的工作已与守灵人相去甚远。","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"好，涅梅丝。你刚刚说到宴会......谁要举办宴会？","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"几天之后，深池会开一场庆功会，所有高层的人物都会参加，爱布拉娜殿下也在其中。我最近就在忙这件事。","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"庆功会？在居民们用土豆充当“炖肉”和“烤鳞”的时候？","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":203},{"type":"multiline","name":"涅梅丝","text":"土豆的事一开始是因为匮乏，后来人们就只是......","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":205},{"type":"multiline","name":"涅梅丝","text":"习惯了。","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"但深池也知道城里的情况，说是宴会，至少我没在清单上看到什么吃喝的环节。","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我不是在替谁粉饰，拉芙希妮小姐。我相信深池不会做出那种置塔拉人于不顾的事。","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"抱歉，拉芙希妮小姐，我得先离开了。","id":212},{"type":"dialog","id":213},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"0.7","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","focus":"l","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":216},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":217},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"她走得急匆匆的......","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"如果直接祛除紫火会引发恐慌，那么，假如在大家不知情的情况下，去——","id":221},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#8$1","focus":"n","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"背后的声音","text":"去把你想要的东西抓在手里？","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"谁？","id":226},{"type":"dialog","id":227},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":231},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":232},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":233,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":234},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":235},{"type":"text","text":"高尚的红龙转过身去，看到一个明晃晃地燃烧着紫火的身影。","id":236},{"type":"dialog","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$2","duration":"1","id":238},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":239},{"type":"text","text":"不，如果说城里其他的居民“沾染”了火焰，面前这个人倒不如说是紫火凝结成的一样，看似毫不炽烈，却连周身的光线都扭曲了。","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"可惜，你想要的东西无聊透顶。","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"毕竟塔拉的火焰已经染上了颜色，这是既定事实。","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你知道火的事。","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"碰巧知道。","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"请把你知道的事情告诉我。这很重要。","id":249},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"告诉你？凭什么？","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我需要阻止人们被紫火吞没。","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"然后换上你自己的火，是不是？","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"只要这一城人能够安然无恙，火焰的颜色并不重要。","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"这么冠冕堂皇的废话，简直都让人怀念起来了，红龙。你这借口拙劣到好笑了。","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"先生，你和我姐姐......有什么关系？","id":261},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"charslot","id":263},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮向前踏出一步，那身影也往后退了一步，和她保持着距离。","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"关系？你，你的姐姐，还有我，我们本性相同，我们都渴望权力、争斗、残杀......","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"我们都对接下来要发生的事情摩拳擦掌，恨不得立刻就用火把一切烧光。","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"但这次我弃权。在这座巢穴被火焰焚尽之前，我会为你们两边同时助威的。","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"再见了——","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"等等！","id":272},{"type":"dialog","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":274},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":275},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_fireharm","volume":"0.8","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":278},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_defboost","volume":"0.5","id":279},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":280},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":281},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":282},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":283},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":284},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hgmdspr","volume":"1","id":285},{"type":"charslot","duration":"2","id":286},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":287},{"type":"text","text":"红龙试图将生命的火焰编织成牢笼，但在牢笼成型之前，那身影就被风吹散。","id":288},{"type":"text","text":"火只是短暂地照亮了那影子长长的尾巴......","id":289},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"charslot","id":293},{"type":"bgeffect","id":294},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":295},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":296},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"而后归于虚无。","id":298},{"type":"dialog","id":299},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":300},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":301},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":302},{"type":"charslot","id":303},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_bg_bg_ltroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":305},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loading_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":306,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":308},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_stage","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"nw","id":309},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"2","channel":"nw","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":311},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"老爷。","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"是你呀。怎么了，这种时候跑来见我？","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"别告诉我你的粮店又出了什么岔子要我管。我从来没把你当下属，我们是“生意伙伴”，懂吗？","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"我明白。","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"明白就好。我这儿又有一批货需要你押出城。一会儿就出发，宵禁之前回来。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"老爷，我说的就是这个——","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"哪个？","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"之前运出城的那些谷物......您说过不影响城内正常粮食供应的，可现在大家还是只能吃土豆......","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"那你知道塔拉其他地方什么样吗？他们连土豆都没得吃！","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"纳斯尔纱的农产品产量已经很高了，事急从权，我们是在帮助自己的同胞，懂吗？","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"而且，光是上次那几车大麦，你就从里面赚了多少？","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"......","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"退一万步讲，纳斯尔纱人也不是没得吃了，起码土豆还能填饱肚子。","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"更不用说农业地块很快就能收获，到时候多的是新的粮食，我还怕你的粮店卖不出去呢。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"不过呢，我也不喜欢勉强。如果你实在过意不去，那就把你的经营许可转让掉，粮店也别开了。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"那我吃什么呢？","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"都说了，你不是我下属。我为什么要管生意伙伴吃什么？","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"行了，一会儿把许可交上来吧——","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":343},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"不，老爷，别！我愿意的！","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"哼。","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"唉......","id":349},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"还站在这儿不走干什么？","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"还有一件事，我听朋友说，林中的黑雾最近可能......","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"黑雾？如果连这都需要你来提醒，那我也不用干了。","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"像往常一样，出城门之后自然有人接应，剩下的事用不着你操心。走吧。","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":358},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":359},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_stage","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"cw","id":360},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"2","channel":"cw","id":361},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":362},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":363},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":364},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_406_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":365},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_406_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"匆忙的士兵","text":"大人。","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_406_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"怎么了？早上“校官”来巡查的时候，那家伙说什么了？","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_406_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"匆忙的士兵","text":"不，“校官”大人上午没来。领袖派他做别的事情去了。","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_406_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"呼。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"那你这么慌里慌张的做什么？","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_406_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"匆忙的士兵","text":"是南部的农业地块已经正式进入收获期了。","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_406_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"这不是好事吗？","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_406_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"匆忙的士兵","text":"是的，但，那个，毕竟城里的熟练农业工人都不在了......","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_406_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"嗐，手册上怎么说，你们就怎么做，明白吗？","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_406_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"匆忙的士兵","text":"是！","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_406_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"对了，整个地块产量预估有多少？报给我，到时候我整合一下。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_406_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"匆忙的士兵","text":"我们也是头回做这种工作......","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_406_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"没用的东西！庄稼熟没熟都看不出来吗？","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_406_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"匆忙的士兵","text":"熟肯定是熟了，不然我们也不可能收......","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_406_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"那不就是一切正常吗？按往年的正常产量报！回去回去！","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_406_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":397},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":398},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":399},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":400},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":401},{"type":"dialog","id":402},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":403},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":404},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":405},{"type":"charslot","id":406},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":407},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":408},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":409,"musicid":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":410},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":411},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#9$1","duration":"0.7","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1693_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":413},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你好，我是游牧人布莉吉。","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1693_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烦躁的守卫","text":"什么事？","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我在纳斯尔纱城里的信都送完了。我想去纳斯尔纱的最高点，让风把我的消息带给我的兄弟姐妹们，然后我就离开城市。","id":420},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1693_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烦躁的守卫","text":"啊，我想起来了，是你啊。来了这么多次，我们哪次都没放你上去，怎么还不长记性？","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"就连维多利亚人在这里的时候，他们也允许我到堡垒的高处去的。","id":424},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1693_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烦躁的守卫","text":"你觉得我是维多利亚人？","id":426},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"不，你是塔拉人。","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1693_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烦躁的守卫","text":"那你就该知道，都是塔拉人，我们就没必要再惯着你们那些老掉牙的臭毛病。什么游牧人啊守灵人啊，装神弄鬼的。","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烦躁的守卫","text":"赶紧走！再不走，小心我把你逮起来！","id":431},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......走就走，有什么好生气的？","id":433},{"type":"dialog","id":434},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":435},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":436},{"type":"charslot","id":437},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":438},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":439},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":440},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":441},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":442},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"除了送信，一件事也没做成。","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"哦，至少赶在宵禁之前出城了，现在只需要穿过黑林，回到原野上——","id":445},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"唉，但愿林中的黑雾会让我过去。","id":447},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"不过黑雾一向不阻拦游牧人的，我担心这个干什么呢？","id":449},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":450},{"type":"dialog","id":451},{"type":"charslot","id":452},{"type":"playsound","key":"$leaveshake","volume":"1","id":453},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_reedmarshes","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"lf1","id":454},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.7","fadetime":"2","channel":"lf1","id":455},{"type":"text","text":"游牧人踢了一脚路边的落叶，让沙沙的声响回荡在眼前空旷的深林里。","id":456},{"type":"text","text":"出乎她的意料，这声音并未逐渐停下，而是形成了反复的回音。","id":457},{"type":"dialog","id":458},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":459},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":460},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"1","id":461},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":462},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":463},{"type":"text","text":"布莉吉于是猛地蹲下身去，试图捂住眼前那些散碎的叶片。声音正从那里传来。","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"对不起，不该踢你们的。","id":465},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":466,"musicid":6},{"type":"dialog","id":467},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":468},{"type":"text","text":"回音仍未停止。","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"呃——","id":470},{"type":"dialog","id":471},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","fadetime":"1.5","channel":"lf1","id":472},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":473},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":474},{"type":"text","text":"这声浪不仅没有停止，甚至回响得越来越大，越来越大，直至变成令人难以忍受，震耳欲聋的噪音。","id":475},{"type":"dialog","id":476},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blacksmoke_01","fade":"true","fadetime":"2","layer":"1","id":477},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":478},{"type":"text","text":"与此同时，黑雾从她的脚边漫上来，捂上她的眼睛，堵住她的耳朵——","id":479},{"type":"dialog","id":480},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"lf1","fadetime":"2","id":481},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":482},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":483},{"type":"bgeffect","layer":"1","fadetime":"1.5","id":484},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":485},{"type":"text","text":"直到她发现自己又回到了黑林的入口。","id":486},{"type":"dialog","id":487},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":488},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":489},{"type":"charslot","id":490},{"type":"bgeffect","id":491},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":492},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#5$1","id":493},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":494},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":495},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":496},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":497},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......第五次！","id":498},{"type":"dialog","id":499},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":500},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":501},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_headknock","volume":"1","id":502},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_headknock","volume":"0.7","loop":"false","channel":"stp1","delay":"0.4","id":503},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","random":"true","power":"5","times":"60","duration":"0.5","id":504},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":505},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"不打算放我离开，非要让我回城里去，是吗？","id":507},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"哼，我不会回去的。","id":508},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"大不了去黑林外边搭个帐篷对付几晚，总有我能离开的时候。","id":509},{"type":"dialog","id":510},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":511},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":512},{"type":"charslot","id":513},{"type":"image","id":514}],"characters":["拉芙希妮","友善的居民","“守灵人”","涅梅丝","背后的声音","“放逐王”","担忧的居民","“官僚”","匆忙的士兵","布莉吉","烦躁的守卫"]}